        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Baldwin LON-SBE, Rectangular Longview Handleset with Matching Interior Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Longview Handleset will fit standard pre-drilled doors. It will fit door thicknesses from 1-3/4 inches to 2-1/2 inches. The adjustable latch with fit 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. Choose from dark bronze or white bronze finishes. The Rectangular Longview Handleset with Matching Interior Rose is available as a single cylinder emergency egress or a dummy set. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Baldwin LON-SBE Longview Entrance Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits 2-1/8\" cross bore for both deadbolt and grip with a 1\" edge bore for both grip latch and deadbolt latch.</li>\r\n<li>Baldwin C-Keyway.</li>\r\n<li>Latch: square corner adjustable</li>\r\n<li>Strike: square corner</li>\r\n<li>Brass deadbolt features 1\" throw. Grip offers 1/2\" passage/privacy function bolt.</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt tested to exceed ANSI-BHMA Grade 2 Security.</li>\r\n<li>Warranty: 25 year finish warranty and a limited lifetime mechanical warranty.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Baldwin Reserve Collection Longview Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Exterior Overall Length: 18-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Overall Width: 2-15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Projection: 3-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Plate Width: 2-15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Trim Height: 10-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" - 2\" standard with optional thick door kit for 2\" - 2-1/2\".</li>\r\n<li>Backset: Adjustable for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Longview Handleset with Square Bevel Escutcheon",
                "description": "The Longview Handleset will fit standard pre-drilled doors. It will fit door thicknesses from 1-3/4 inches to 2-1/2 inches. The adjustable latch with fit 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. Choose from dark bronze or white bronze finishes. The Rectangular Longview Handleset with Matching Interior Rose is available as a single cylinder emergency egress or a dummy set.",
